 "strings": {
  "You're damn right you do. I need to know\nwhere I can play cho-han, remember?": "",
  "You sure do.\nI need to know where I can play cho-han, remember?": "",
  "Oh yeah. It's in the Champion District.\nOnly shop without a sign. You can't miss it.": "",
  "Oh yeah... It's in the Champion District.\nOnly shop without a sign.": "",
  "A bar with no sign.": "",
  "A bar with no sign...": "",
  "Knock on the shutter three times,\nand they'll ask you what you want.": "",
  "So... knock on the shutter three times,\nand they'll ask you what you want.": "",
  "You respond with the password:\n\"Can I talk to Moon?\"": "",
  "Knock three times,\nthen the password.": "",
  "Next they'll say, \"He says he wants the steak,\"\nto which you respond, \"Chateaubriand, blue.\"": "",
  "Next they'll say, \"What kinda steak you got,\"\nto which you respond, \"Chateaubriand, blue.\"": "",
  "And that's it. Joint's underground,\nbut clearly that ain't a problem for you.": "",
  "That'll get you in.\nThe place is underground, like this one.": "",
  "Thanks, that's a huge help.": "",
  "Now let's get drinkin'!": "",
  "Now, let's get drinkin'!": "",
  "Actually, I think I'm gonna have to pass.\nI need to go.": "",
  "Actually, I'm gonna have to pass.\nI need to go.": "",
  "Your loss, pal! An ass like that\nis a once-in-a-lifetime deal!": "",
  "Your loss, pal!\nThat's a once-in-a-lifetime ass!": "",
  "Oh yeah. She likes vodka martinis.\nOrder it shaken, not stirred!": "",
  "The hell's that supposed to mean...?": "",
  "What? The hell's that mean...?": "",
  "Sugiura told me you'd be here.": "",
  "So? You find out where Hamura is?": "",
  "How'd it go? You find out\nwhere Hamura is?": "",
  "Yup. A gambling hall\nin the Champion District.": "",
  "Really? Where at?": "",
  "Really? Where in the Champion District?": "",
  "Apparently the only store without a sign.\nThey've got the club set up underground.": "",
  "Huh, fancy.": "",
  "By the way, Tak...\nWhat happens when you find Hamura?": "",
  "By the way, Tak...\nwhen you find Hamura, what happens next?": "",
  "The first thing I'm gonna do is vent.": "",
  "The first thing I'm gonna do\nis vent on him a bit.": "",
  "After everything he's done,\nhe deserves it.": "",
  "After all this, he deserves it.": "",
  "If I'm honest, I'd take more joy in seeing him\nsquirm than finding the Mole right about now.": "",
  "I don't even care if we find\nthe Mole there if I get to kick his ass.": "",
  "Glad we're on the same page.": "",
  "Now you're talkin'.\nGlad we're on the same page.": "",
  "Let's go.": "",
  "Yo, hold up.": "",
  "I don't see a sign anywhere.\nThis where we get in the gambling hall?": "",
  "I don't see a sign anywhere.\nIs this it? The way to the gambling hall, I mean?": "",
  "What're we stickin' around here for?\nLet's get to the Champion District, man.": "",
  "(Gotta knock on the door first.\nHow many times should I do it?)": "",
  "Huh? I don't hear anything.\nYou sure we got the right place?": "",
  "What's up? I don't hear anything.\nYou sure we got the right place?": "",
  "Weird. Maybe that was the wrong\nnumber of knocks...": "",
  "Huh? That's weird. Maybe it was\nthe wrong number of knocks...": "",
  "Dude, you sure that guy wasn't pulling\nyour leg? You just look like a moron.": "",
  "Hey, uh, you sure that guy wasn't pulling your leg?\nLooks like you're just doing shit at random.": "",
  "Don't worry, I've got this.": "",
  "Don't worry. I've got this.": "",
  "...What do you want?": "",
  "(All right, now for the password.\nI think it started with...)": "",
  "Moon sure is bright tonight.": "",
  "He's not saying anything...\nWhy isn't he saying anything?": "",
  "Hey... Why isn't he saying anything?": "",
  "Guess I said it wrong.\nShoulda wrote that down.": "",
  "Guess I gave him the wrong password.\nWhat was it again?": "",
  "Don't tell me you forgot\nthe password.": "",
  "What? No, of course not.\nI'll get it, I'll get it.": "",
  "It's fine! We'll be fine.": "",
  "You ever been mooned?": "",
  "I'm looking for a guy named Moon.": "",
  "Can I talk to Moon?": "",
  "...He says he wants steak.\nPick one for him.": "",
  "He says he wants steak.": "",
  "(Onto step two.\nThe second password is...)": "",
  "Tenderloin, medium.": "",
  "Sounds like he's got some beef.": "",
  "Sounds like he's got beef.": "",
  "Ugh, why'd they have to make this so complicated?\nI'm gonna get it this time!": "",
  "Dammit, why'd they have to make this so complicated?\nI'm gonna get it this time!": "",
  "You hungry, man? I can go grab\nyou something if you want.": "",
  "You're not placing an order\nfor dinner here, right?": "",
  "No, it's part of this damn password.\nThough now that you mention it...": "",
  "I'm <font_kind=yakuza_italic>trying</font_kind> to get this damn password.\nThough now that you mention it...": "",
  "Ribeye, well done.": "",
  "Sirloin, medium rare.": "",
  "Chateaubriand, blue.": "",
  "Thank you for your order.\nEnjoy your meal.": "",
  "Nice goin', Tak!": "",
  "Yeah! Nice goin', Tak!": "",
  "Phew. I could go for a steak now...": "",
  "Smoke continues to billow out of\nthe Champion District fire as we speak.": "",
  "The apparent cause is a small explosion which\ntook place in a covert gambling hall not long ago.": "",
  "The apparent cause is a small explosion\nwhich took place in a covert gambling hall not long ago.": "",
  "Eyewitnesses claim they heard the sound of explosives\nbeing detonated in the establishment.": "",
  "According to our sources, a grenade may have\nbeen detonated inside the building.": "",
  "However, the building was deserted by the time firefighters\nand police arrived on the scene.": "",
  "However, the structure was deserted by the time\nfirefighters and police arrived on the scene.": "",
  "With the horror of gang violence still fresh in our minds,\nthe incident only raises tension across the city.": "",
  "With Kamurocho's gang violence still fresh in our minds,\ntension is high throughout the city.": "",
  "Sounds like the plan didn't go so well.": "",
  "Yikes... Sounds like the plan\ndidn't go so well.": "",
  "They were desperate.\nStill, we did manage to talk to Hamura.": "",
  "Which is how you found out Shono is the one\ngiving him orders, right? Not Director Kido.": "",
  "And... that's how you found out Shono is the one\ngiving him orders, yes? Not Director Kido.": "",
  "Yup. At least, that's the\nlook he was giving us.": "",
  "That's what I read from\nHamura's face, anyway.": "",
  "You... can tell that just from a look?": "",
  "You... got that from a look?": "",
  "Gimme a break.\nI don't know how else to put it.": "",
  "Don't rub it in.\nI don't know how else to put it.": "",
  "Well, I guess that look is all\nwe have to go off.": "",
  "Well, I guess that look\nis the best clue we have.": "",
  "Did you come to taunt me or help me?": "",
  "Oh yeah? Is that sarcasm?": "",
  "Don't be mean, Yagami-san.\nOf course I came to help.": "",
  "Of course not. I came to help you,\nnot make fun of you.": "",
  "Help how?": "",
  "I found someone who's an expert on AD-9.": "",
  "I found someone who's an expert\non AD-9.": "",
  "Looking into that research paper might be our\nbest shot at finding more leads.": "",
  "If we want leads, it might be best\nif we focus on the research paper.": "",
  "And I don't know about you,\nbut I can't understand a word of what it says.": "",
  "Yup, same.": "",
  "Same.": "",
  "But I found somebody who can.": "",
  "But I think I've found someone\nwho can.": "",
  "I'm impressed.\nGood work, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "Whoa. Good work, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "Just... don't get mad, okay?": "",
  "Mad? Why would I get mad?": "",
  "Why would I?": "",
  "Well, that expert I found...\nIt's Hattori-san, that journalist you kinda hate.": "",
  "That expert I found...\nIt's Hattori-san, the journalist.": "",
  "Please, he's written a lot of articles on AD-9\nand has interviewed all the top medical researchers.": "",
  "Hattori-san's written a lot of articles on AD-9, and\nhe's interviewed all the top medicinal researchers.": "",
  "That guy? Seriously?\nThis has gotta be some kind of joke.": "",
  "That guy? Seriously?\nYou gotta be kidding.": "",
  "He said he'd tell us what we want to know\nif you asked him nicely...": "",
  "He said he'd tell us what we want to know\nif you asked him <font_kind=yakuza_italic>really</font_kind> nicely...": "",
  "Yeah, you know what? Let's drop it.\nI don't care about the paper.": "",
  "Nope. You know, I think we'll be fine without.\nI don't care about the paper.": "",
  "That research could contain vital information\nfor this case we're building.": "",
  "This isn't an opportunity\nwe can afford to miss.": "",
  "But if we ask him for help now,\nhe's gonna want something in return later...": "",
  "Yeah, but when you\nask the devil for a favor...": "",
  "Hattori-san's waiting for you at Kyushu No. 1 Star.\nApparently he's doing a story on them.": "",
  "Come on, Yagami-san.\nGet going.": "",
  "Sound good?\nPlease, we need this.": "",
  "Hm? Oh, I didn't notice\nyou there, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hm? Oh, I didn't notice you\nthere, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Don't tell me you're using a phone camera\nto take pictures for your article.": "",
  "The resolution on these things is plenty high\nnowadays. You have a problem?": "",
  "Yes. The resolution on these things is plenty high nowadays.\nThat a problem?": "",
  "Just didn't know sensationalist\nfood columns were a thing.": "",
  "Turning into a gourmet reporter\nor something?": "",
  "I only report on things that interest me.\nThat's my professional philosophy.": "",
  "Well is it gonna take a while?\nI'm here to talk.": "",
  "Don't worry,\nI'll be done soon.": "",
  "I'll be done in a sec.": "",
  "Do I seriously have to go alone for this?": "",
  "Hattori-san's bad enough,\nbut I have deal with him alone?": "",
  "Yes. Hattori-san is making\ntime especially for you.": "",
  "Yes, he's making time\nespecially for you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "There's no reason for me to come along.": "",
  "There's no reason for me\nto come along.": "",
  "Just imagine you're going for a nice bowl of ramen.\nYou'll be done before you know it.": "",
  "If it helps, just imagine you're going to this\nKyushu No. 1 Star for a bowl of ramen? Yeah?": "",
  "All right, I'm done.\nThanks for stopping by, Yagami-san.": "",
  "All right, I'm done.\nThanks for coming by.": "",
  "Kinda strange sharing a bowl\nof ramen with you.": "",
  "Kinda strange, sharing a bowl\nof ramen with you.": "",
  "I thought the day would never come.": "",
  "Can we skip this part?": "",
  "Heh. Relax, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Heh. You can relax, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Are you still working for Kajihira?": "",
  "So? You still working for Chairman Kajihira?": "",
  "I'm not sure I'd go that far.": "",
  "He just calls me in for favors every now and again.": "",
  "He just calls me in for favors\nevery now and again.": "",
  "Helps to be on good terms with the guy.\nFor my job, you know?": "",
  "Helps to be on good terms with the guy.\nGoes hand-in-hand with the job.": "",
  "Uh-huh...": "",
  "It'd be nice to be close with you too, Yagami-san.": "",
  "It'd be nice to be close\nwith you too, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I heard you were the one who discovered\nShintani-sensei's corpse, after all.": "",
  "After all... I heard about Shintani-sensei's death.\nHow you were the one who found him.": "",
  "I'm here to talk AD-9.": "",
  "I thought you called me here\nto talk about AD-9.": "",
  "If that's not what this is about,\nI'm not sticking around.": "",
  "If not, I've got places to be.": "",
  "All right, all right.\nBut you'll owe me for this.": "",
  "Fine, I get it.\nBut... you'll owe me for this.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Ugh. This is why I didn't\nwant to talk to him.)</color>": "",
  "Generally, drug development starts with the discovery\nof a compound that can treat a given disease.": "",
  "Generally, when they develop new drugs, it's based on\nthe discovery of a compound that can treat a disease.": "",
  "That compound becomes the candidate for a drug.": "",
  "That compound becomes the\ncandidate for a drug.": "",
  "They then test its effects on animals,\nafter which the drug heads to clinical trials.": "",
  "Which is a nicer way of saying\nhuman experimentation, by the way.": "",
  "\"Clinical trials\" being their diplomatic name\nfor human experimentation, of course.": "",
  "As for the process...": "",
  "It can take years, sometimes even longer,\nto ensure a drug is truly safe for public consumption.": "",
  "Well, making a drug truly safe for public consumption\ntakes a lot of time. Years, or even longer.": "",
  "Yeah, yeah.\nIt's tough, I get it.": "",
  "Sure, it's tough, I get it.": "",
  "Before now, Alzheimer's drugs have only\nbeen able to slow the progress of the disease.": "",
  "Before now, we've had some drugs for Alzheimer's,\nbut they've only ever slowed the disease down.": "",
  "None can cure it completely.": "",
  "None of them have been able to\ncure it completely.": "",
  "But Director Kido's AD-9 proved remarkably\neffective at doing just that when tested on mice.": "",
  "But then Director Kido's AD-9 turned up.\nAnd it's worked perfectly in tests on mice, at least.": "",
  "If it can work on humans as well...\nMaybe we can finally kiss Alzheimer's goodbye.": "",
  "If it can work on humans as well...\nmaybe we can finally kiss Alzheimer's goodbye.": "",
  "At least, that's what the paper\nthey published a year ago claimed.": "",
  "That was the thesis of the paper, anyway...\nThe one you found, published a year ago.": "",
  "In this country, one in four people\nover the age of eighty is affected by dementia.": "",
  "That means for a couple in their fifties,\nthere's a good chance that one of their parents has it.": "",
  "By those numbers, for an average couple in their fifties,\nthere's a good chance that one of their parents has it.": "",
  "And the odds that one member of that couple will\ndevelop it themselves is 50-50.": "",
  "And the odds that one member of that couple\nwill develop it themselves...? 50-50.": "",
  "No matter how you look at it,\ndementia is an inescapable issue.": "",
  "There's no denying that dementia\nis an inescapable issue.": "",
  "If I ever experienced symptoms myself,\nI'd go to the doctor straight away.": "",
  "If I ever experienced symptoms myself...\nI'd go straight to the doctor.": "",
  "In some cases, they can slow the progress\nenough that you can even keep working.": "",
  "In some cases, the docs can slow the disease down.\nEnough that you can even keep working.": "",
  "I guess my point is, dementia's not something\nto fear. It's a possibility to prepare for.": "",
  "My point is, dementia's not some farfetched horror story.\nIt's a fact of life.": "",
  "Our biggest enemy is ignorance and apathy.\nKinda reminds me of someone.": "",
  "The way I see it... The real dangers here are\nignorance and apathy. Reminds me of someone... ": "",
  "I'm listening.": "",
  "Good. I'd like to give you a rundown of what\nexactly Alzheimer's is, then. You interested?": "",
  "I'd like to give you a rundown of what exactly\nAlzheimer's is, then. You interested?": "",
  "You're gonna even if I say no, right?": "",
  "You'd do it even\nif I said no, right?": "",
  "You bet I would.\nNow, let's begin.": "",
  "You bet.\nNow, let's begin.": "",
  "Out of all the diseases that can cause dementia,\nAlzheimer's accounts for roughly 70% of cases.": "",
  "It's believed to be brought about by build-up of\na protein called amyloid beta in the brain.": "",
  "It's believed to be brought about by build-up\nof a protein called amyloid beta in the brain.": "",
  "When that happens, nerve cells start dying off\nand the brain begins to atrophy.": "",
  "Nerve cells start dying off,\nand the brain begins to atrophy.": "",
  "So to put this in layman's terms...\nWaste buildup kind of shrinks the brain.": "",
  "So basically, with all that waste buildup in the brain...\nit starts to shrink?": "",
  "That's one way to put it, yes.": "",
  "...To put it roughly, yes.": "",
  "But even that is just a theory at this point.\nThere's still much to learn about Alzheimer's.": "",
  "And when your brain shrinks?": "",
  "And what happens when\nyour brain shrinks?": "",
  "Your memory is impaired.": "",
  "Let me explain. There are three processes\ninvolved in memory: encoding, storage, and retrieval.": ""
